From a9adcb787589bdf27d9d3238d3b6b2c443666866 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stefan Schaefer <stefanschaefer@BlackGuard.fritz.box>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 01:43:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Settings: MapViewer3D Live Data (pairing codes for the
 optional mapviewer-live stack)

New Settings section "MapViewer3D Live Data": status of the optional
mapviewer-live compose stack (mvagent + mvgate), key fingerprint, Create
Pairing Code (shown once, never stored or audited) and Revoke All Pairings.

- services/mapViewerLive.js: docker ps/inspect/exec/restart via execFile with
  fixed arguments; the public address is validated first
- routes: GET /api/settings/mapviewer-live (settings:read),
  POST .../pairing-code and .../revoke (settings:write, never reachable with
  an API key), GET /api/mapviewer-live/status (maps:read, secret-free
  capability answer for MapViewer3D, cached 15 s)
- warns before showing a pairing code over plain HTTP
- tests: test/mapViewerLive.test.js, MapViewerLiveSection.test.tsx
- docs/console/mapviewer-live.md

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
